# AstrBot runtime data - never commit
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: a bare `data/` also swallowed
# `modules/<name>/data/*.json` (the recruit module's built-in dataset),
# which silently kept a required file out of git while tests stayed green.
/data/
/config/

